.TH ARGUS-GUI 1 "2026-11-27" "argus 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
argus-gui \- desktop front-end for the argus security scanner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B argus-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B argus-gui
starts the Tk front-end shipped with
.BR argus (1).
It can start a scan, browse findings, filter and sort results, inspect
dependency trees and compare two JSON reports.
.PP
The GUI requires tkinter and a working display.  Install
.B python3-tk
and make sure \fBDISPLAY\fR or \fBWAYLAND_DISPLAY\fR is set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR argus (1),
.I /usr/share/doc/argus-scanner/README.md
.SH AUTHOR
argus contributors.
